<title>INDIA: India's ACC 1996/97 net seen halving-poll.</title>
<headline>India's ACC 1996/97 net seen halving-poll.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Net profit of India's leading cement maker Associated Cement Companies (ACC) is expected to tumble 58.05 percent to 951.37 million rupees in the year ended March 31, 1997, a Reuter poll of 28 leading securities and brokerage firms said.</p>
<p>Projections ranged from 509 million rupees to 1.39 billion</p>
<p>rupees against 2.27 billion in year-ago period.</p>
<p>.</p>
<p>ACC    ----PAT seen down 58.05%, sales 4.83%</p>
<p>			Net profit  1995/96     Net sales  1995/96</p>
<p>				 (in million rupees)</p>
<p>Average		  951.37   2,267.80   22,298.74   23,429.90</p>
<p>High		   1,390.00		  25,750.00</p>
<p>Low			509.00		  19,064.10</p>
<p>--Bombay newsroom +91-22-265-9000</p>
